@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ActivityFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
start
:Compare the first client's preferences, then dealbreakers,
against the second client;
:Compare the second client's preferences, then dealbreakers,
against the first client;
note right
Each comparison is MET, UNMET or UNKNOWN.
It is UNKNOWN when the other client's
attribute is not recorded.
end note

'Since the beta syntax does not support placing the condition outside the
'diamond we place it as the true branch instead.

if () then ([any dealbreaker comparison is UNMET])
    :Outcome is INCOMPATIBLE;
elseif () then ([no comparisons, or any comparison is UNKNOWN])
    :Outcome is INSUFFICIENT_INFORMATION;
else ([else])
    :Outcome is COMPATIBLE;
endif
stop
@enduml
